        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The optimal approach combines early planning, a detailed inventory, and using Shree Ashirwad’s dedicated container trucks. Their 7‑layer packaging protects delicate items, while the instant estimate tool helps budget accurately. Scheduling the move during off‑peak traffic hours further reduces transit delays.</p>
